---
source: tui/src/monitor_tests.rs
expression: "format!(\"{message}\\n\\n{}\", hint.expect(\"status hint\"))"
---
Command monitors (2):
- project-watch (running, trusted output) in /workspace/project: ./watch-for-changes
- ci (paused) in /workspace/project: gh pr checks --watch

Monitor commands:
  /monitor add <name> [--cwd <directory>] [--trust] -- <command>
  /monitor list
  /monitor pause <name>
  /monitor resume <name>
  /monitor remove <name>

Options for add:
  --cwd <directory>  Run the command from this directory (defaults to the session cwd)
  --trust            Deliver output without the untrusted-input warning
  --                 End monitor options and begin the command

Example:
  /monitor add project-watch --cwd ~/project --trust -- ./watch-for-changes
